    "description": {
      "value": "<p>This weak jinx is a classic training spell between duelists, a startling sting on impact. Make a ranged spell attack against a creature within range. On a hit, it takes 1d6 force damage, and it can't take reactions until the start of its next turn.</p>\n<p>The spell's damage increases by 1d6 when you reach 5th level (2d6), 11th level (3d6), and 17th level (4d6).</p>",
